:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"合成阳性对照C：40 mg，每2周一次（皮下注射）；24周","quote_sha256":"650ba0a3f1995366f4c39225fcc1eb45cf30f597485bb807f1ac7dbcf3dafee5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"ev_dose_c"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"剂量调整：不设置计划性剂量调整；因安全性需要的暂停或永久停药按方案停药标准处理。","quote_sha256":"c5ee70f45469d0d4ef33855964e6b4348b784a0b2ab5c9011697efc45f910309","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"ev_dose_adjustment"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_section_title_ch71","ev_periods","ev_visits","ev_intervention","ev_dose_b","ev_dose_c","ev_dose_adjustment"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索经确认的访视程序表，明确各访视操作顺序与时间窗。","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_7_1_visit_procedures","missing_source_classes":["访视程序表"],"target":"7.1 研究程序"},{"action":"补充试验用药品包装、储存、发放、回收与销毁的项目文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_7_1_drug_management","missing_source_classes":["试验用药品管理文件"],"target":"7.1 研究程序"},{"action":"补充因安全性需要暂停或永久停药的停药标准与处理流程。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_7_1_dose_interruption","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整和停药标准文件"],"target":"7.1 研究程序"},{"action":"检索随机化与盲法实施文件，确认1:1分层随机和双模拟维持盲态的程序描述依据。","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_7_1_randomization_blinding","missing_source_classes":["随机化和盲法实施文件"],"target":"7.1 研究程序"}],"heading":"研究程序","missing_source_classes":["访视程序表","试验用药品管理文件","剂量调整和停药标准文件","随机化和盲法实施文件"],"proposal_text":"研究程序自筛选期开始，筛选期持续4周，用于完成入组条件确认与基线评估。符合入组条件的试验参与者进入24周双盲双模拟治疗期，并按分配接受持续24周的试验治疗：试验组口服合成试验药B 50 mg每日一次，同时接受阳性对照模拟注射；对照组口服合成试验药B匹配安慰剂每日一次，同时皮下注射合成阳性对照C 40 mg每2周一次。两组在整个治疗期内均继续接受稳定甲氨蝶呤治疗。本研究不设置计划性剂量调整。治疗期结束并完成第24周访视后，试验参与者进入4周安全性随访期，并在第28周完成安全性随访访视。","rationale":"本段依据已确认事实写入筛选期4周、治疗期24周与安全性随访期4周，访视包括筛选、基线及第2、4、8、12、16、20、24周和第28周安全性随访，试验组口服合成试验药B 50 mg每日一次并接受阳性对照模拟注射，对照组口服匹配安慰剂每日一次并皮下注射合成阳性对照C 40 mg每2周一次，两组继续稳定甲氨蝶呤治疗，且不设置计划性剂量调整。医学审核需确认逐访视操作、试验用药品管理与停药处理等实施细节。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_ad60fcf83e50edbb","section_number":"7.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b9b9dc425368acc0878fcbec","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922155356_b3de84b8","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_b209d029cdd23382:full-draft:b9b9dc425368acc0878fcbec","quote":"章节标题=筛选期与基线","quote_sha256":"a14e7a7c536559a1b787efa2de292ab9cb657668bcfa09eadeadbee974637404","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:b9b9dc425368acc0878fcbec","span_id":"ev_section_title_ch711"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期4周。；双盲双模拟治疗期24周。；安全性随访期4周。","quote_sha256":"3bfef9b5c99840973d468cd7875097ed081dba51f84af025bb7f2dc1a992586a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"ev_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"目标研究人群：18–75岁、稳定甲氨蝶呤治疗后仍为中高疾病活动度的类风湿关节炎成人试验参与者。","quote_sha256":"0ab47e23258a396edd7543a2d919116227f680bc2be10f409cc7c3364fdcb677","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"ev_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"入选标准模块：诊断类风湿关节炎至少6个月；筛选及基线时DAS28-CRP≥3.2；甲氨蝶呤稳定剂量治疗至少8周。","quote_sha256":"aefd31a236bfd5c8fd6bbf69276263879baa4d2f85ae523d0fec21d0961772e0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"ev_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"排除标准模块：既往对研究药或阳性对照不耐受；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"a84d3818dbfb446a1819a205cd6ee4dc82111a86ce76e0c7f1e0a9a3648a75d0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"ev_exclusion"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_section_title_ch711","ev_periods","ev_population","ev_inclusion","ev_exclusion"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充筛选失败与重新筛选的项目文件规则及筛选期时间窗要求。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_7_1_1_screening_rerun","missing_source_classes":["筛选失败与重新筛选规则文件"],"target":"7.1.1 筛选期与基线"},{"action":"检索经确认的基线评估清单，明确基线评估项目与操作顺序。","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_7_1_1_baseline_assessments","missing_source_classes":["基线评估清单"],"target":"7.1.1 筛选期与基线"},{"action":"补充筛选期实验室检查与疾病活动度评估的操作文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_7_1_1_screening_lab","missing_source_classes":["实验室手册"],"target":"7.1.1 筛选期与基线"},{"action":"补充妊娠检测流程与哺乳期评估要求的项目文件。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_7_1_1_pregnancy_test","missing_source_classes":["妊娠检测流程"],"target":"7.1.1 筛选期与基线"}],"heading":"筛选期与基线","missing_source_classes":["筛选失败与重新筛选规则文件","基线评估清单","实验室手册","妊娠检测流程"],"proposal_text":"筛选期持续4周，用于确认试验参与者是否符合入组条件并完成基线评估。试验参与者应为18–75岁、稳定甲氨蝶呤治疗后仍为中高疾病活动度的类风湿关节炎成人。入选条件包括：诊断类风湿关节炎至少6个月；筛选及基线时DAS28-CRP≥3.2；甲氨蝶呤稳定剂量治疗至少8周。排除条件包括：既往对研究药或阳性对照不耐受；存在活动性严重感染；处于妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。基线评估在双盲双模拟治疗期给药开始前完成，其结果为后续疗效与安全性评价提供参照。完成筛选且符合全部入选条件、不符合任何排除条件的试验参与者，方可进入24周双盲双模拟治疗期。","rationale":"本段依据已确认事实写入筛选期4周、目标研究人群为18–75岁且稳定甲氨蝶呤治疗后仍为中高疾病活动度的类风湿关节炎成人，入选条件为诊断类风湿关节炎至少6个月、筛选及基线时DAS28-CRP≥3.2、甲氨蝶呤稳定剂量治疗至少8周，排除条件为既往对研究药或阳性对照不耐受、活动性严重感染、妊娠或哺乳以及研究者判断不适合参加。医学审核需确认筛选失败再筛、基线评估项目、实验室检查与妊娠检测流程。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_02b92c978cd30d9a","section_number":"7.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b9b9dc425368acc0878fcbec","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"d7571fbb4ecd087d12e86d57a1e31049f7c9e2060e795178c59ff29dfdb5e7ba","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_b209d029cdd23382:full-draft:b9b9dc425368acc0878fcbec","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:b9b9dc425368acc0878fcbec","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:defc9b2a5fb939bebce57c9f1eb47eb7b7a5651124c6cd0f737697349c57cfb1:b9b9dc425368acc0878fcbec","text_sha256":"d7571fbb4ecd087d12e86d57a1e31049f7c9e2060e795178c59ff29dfdb5e7ba"},{"content_sha256":"c5bf2d0afd5d40df8334c8e3453d30d7faf52e6f4d22546778d8bae4c48f8aba","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","text_sha256":"c5bf2d0afd5d40df8334c8e3453d30d7faf52e6f4d22546778d8bae4c48f8aba"},{"content_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","source_type":"company